This directory is empty and tracked on purpose.

git does not version directories, only files — so a repository that has
src/components/ui/ locally ships a clone that does not. Stage #1 of the pipeline
reads this path to build its component inventory, and an absent directory is not
the same fact as an empty one: the first says "this repository is not a design
system", the second says "no components yet", which is where every design system
starts.

Delete this file once the first component lands.
